            PER-BINARY ORACLE GATE
          </text>
          <text class="project-visual__stage-label" x="520" y="286">
            NEGATIVE CONDITIONING RESULT
          </text>
          <text class="project-visual__body" x="520" y="316">
            do not add a learned routing layer
          </text>
          <text class="project-visual__micro" x="520" y="338">
            CORPUS-SPECIFIC DECISION
          </text>
        </g>
